  "2026-11-07T10:45:19.450Z",codex-agent,"Full npm run release:check passed in 854 seconds. Every one of the 49 behavioral mutations reached its intended named AssertionError, followed by 56 restored passing tests. New thread mappings: PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60z7wU -> proof:completion_reservation (whole admission and byte-headroom reverts), proof:completion_write (request-only admission reverted), proof:completion_frontier (receipt reserve reverted); PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60z7wb -> proof:node_runtime_selection; PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60z7wc -> proof:fixture_environment; PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60z7wh -> proof:gate_diagnostics. All earlier 42 regressions remain. The old unresolved schema thread PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60xipL remains fixed by the prior shared linear classifier and its hosted alias/complexity tests passed; its later CI-failure report is covered by the new fixture isolation. The Bun full gate now runs serially on unchanged source."
  "2026-11-07T11:01:07.227Z",codex-agent,"Auto round 3 final certification: npm run release:check passed in 854 seconds and bun run release:check passed in 902 seconds, serially in about 29 minutes using at most two workers and isolated HOME/Git configuration. Each passed 61 unskipped tests including 500 seeded journal sequences; 100 percent of 573 statements, 364 branches, 129 functions and 500 lines across nine emitted modules; one packed acceptance test; 49 named behavioral mutation failures; and 56 restored tests. Packed npm/Bun consumers each exercised 56 primary CLI commands plus SDK completion/refusal and exact Node 22.19.0 / 26.13.0 probes with Git absent. Both accepted 44-file archives have SHA-256 a1ff2149e130d23cb9749d9e4b70ba1f5394cfd305757ffd53f5359ab8dc31c5. Typecheck, lint, zero duplication, 94 documented declarations, native health, identity/privacy, zero production audit vulnerabilities, changelog and publication attestation pass at unchanged thresholds. All four new threads are valid and fixed; the earlier unresolved schema thread retains its correct fix and its subsequent CI report is repaired by event isolation. Revert proofs and per-thread mappings are in the preceding certification comment. No local timeout, new SDK gap, dependency-pin change or weakened regression. Four histories inherited from main preserve its exact byte prefix; the fifth changed history is branch-only. Final source is staged explicitly and the 90-file identity/privacy check passes. Hosted checks for the forthcoming pushed head remain pending and separate from these local results; no thread reply/resolution, merge or release."
  "2026-11-07T14:20:49.378Z",codex-agent,"Auto round 4: oriented and reclaimed the existing item; remote head is unchanged and main is included. Complete GraphQL fetch has no omitted thread/comment pages and latest CodeRabbit body has no Outside diff range section. The supplied capacity block is stale: PRRT_kwDOVlPkts60z7wU is already resolved, its latest CodeRabbit comment acknowledges e6e2b53, and remember retains one receipt plus 32 KiB for every write leaving a pending request. Existing completion frontier/reservation/intervening-write and packed SDK/JSON/TOON regressions remain; no duplicate production fix is warranted. Valid new rules: subprocess diagnostics must normalize nullable streams before formatting across every runner, tests must exercise actual failed spawn results, and algorithmic work gates must be deterministic rather than host CPU dependent. Will add real ENOENT/max-buffer cases and a counted regex-work/linear-pattern guard that distinguishes the old polynomial classifier without elapsed-time thresholds."
  "2026-11-07T14:29:25.230Z",codex-agent,"Focused verification passes 26 tests; the expanded deterministic work check also passes for all 2449 forbidden and 566 allowed path spellings. The new grammar rejects overlapping unanchored starts, nested repetition, multiple unbounded atoms and unsafe repeated groups before execution; regex work counts disjoint/sticky input positions and asserts a size-proportional bound with no elapsed-time threshold. Original long-flag privacy and every prior refusal/allow case remain. Real ENOENT returns undefined streams on this Node version, so assertions now cover absent streams portably plus an explicit null/undefined matrix. Real max-buffer and missing npm enumeration cases retain their original error; restored/mutation runners now expose the original error in the assertion header. Shared normalization covers packed installers, runtime probes, tracker fixture checks, coverage and package gates. No product or capacity semantics changed."
  "2026-11-07T14:31:10.080Z",codex-agent,"New-case revert preflight ran only the seven additions in disposable copies: removing null normalization fails proof:spawn_diagnostics; removing regex admission fails proof:linear_guard; reintroducing a CPU clock fails proof:deterministic_work; removing counted work fails proof:regex_count; hiding mutation/restored execution errors fails proof:mutation_spawn and proof:restore_spawn; hiding npm enumeration errors fails proof:pack_spawn. Fourteen restored tests pass for that subset; the upcoming full gate will run all 56 mutations and all affected baseline suites. Current e6e2b53 hosted CI passes Node 22 and Node 26 at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-reduce/actions/runs/42366436617 and CodeQL at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-reduce/actions/runs/42366436669. This additionally confirms the already-fixed capacity report is stale; new-head hosted evidence will remain separate."
  "2026-11-07T14:42:03.294Z",codex-agent,"Self-review strengthened the new deterministic guard against ungrouped top-level alternatives, multiline start positions and wildcard delimiters; all current classifier patterns remain admitted. Added a syntax gate across unit-test sources, including direct/member/optional/destructured/imported clock aliases, so restoring the exact former CPU-threshold test deterministically fails proof:clock_free_gates rather than depending on host speed. This adds one mutation beyond the earlier seven-case preflight: final certification now runs 57 mutation cases. The preliminary npm full gate was intentionally stopped after 159 seconds for these test-guard corrections; its log/result are retained separately, and emitted code was rebuilt before passing 19 focused tests, typecheck, lint, zero duplication and 97 documented declarations. No product behavior changed and no local timeout occurred."
  "2026-11-07T14:56:26.522Z",codex-agent,"Full npm run release:check passed in 683 seconds: 67 unskipped tests, unchanged 100 percent runtime coverage (573 statements / 364 branches / 129 functions / 500 lines, nine modules), 57 named behavioral failures and 62 restored passing tests, plus packed npm/Bun acceptance and all static/self-host/identity/changelog/audit gates. This includes the exact former timing-test function reversion failing proof:clock_free_gates and the old polynomial classifier failing proof:path_complexity without measuring time. Final source is staged explicitly; identity/privacy passes for all 92 tracked files. A separate exact Node 22.19.0 / 26.13.0 focused check follows the observed Node 24 null-vs-undefined difference before the serial Bun full gate."
